      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{63aef086871aaf343e0fc87f|full_name}: I would absolutely love this. Myself and a few friends like to set our home instance to public to immediately jump into public lobbies upon opening the game, this seems like a perfect extension of that.\n\nBeing able to \"come home\" to your \"family\" of friends/group members in VR would such a cool and cozy experience. I'd even say that if this were to be implemented it'd be one of my favourite additions to VRChat.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
