      "mergeID": "6639a33a98d21ccfa7b29e53",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I hope to add a 'group's home' feature, which allows members of a group to automatically join the group's home when entering the game. This feature should be optional, meaning that without any specific configuration, players will still return to their default homes/player-set homes. However, there should be an option in the settings to choose whether the default home is the 'group's home.' Additionally, the 'group's world' setting should be adjustable by the owner and individuals with appropriate permissions.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "group home&world",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "6388d67b8b04a12dd8c8909d",
      "private": false,
      "spam": false,
