      "mergeID": "6639a364ec7160347be8fd9b",
      "mergedPostDetails": "We recently obtained a setting to change our home world to public or friends+ or friends instead of private.\n\nI'd like to be able to set my home world to a particularly group setting with saved configurable options.",
