      "mergeID": "6639a383244f088ae4e529dc",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Good evening,\n\nI contacted you by email but I was asked to send you my message here\n\nI would like to contact you to propose a very interesting idea for the groups on VRChat.\n\nYou could propose a \"homeworld\" in common with all the members of the same group, this will give a higher interest to your subscription.\n\nMany friends agree with my idea and would like to see it in place.\n\nBy hoping to help you, and continue to see your game grow!\n\nI look forward to answering your questions.\n\nGood luck.\n\nMy ID : Roi Grillbad\n\nps : sorry for my bad english, i'm french :)",
      "mergedPostTitle": "HomeWorld pour les groupes",
