      "mergeID": "6639a3b498d21ccfa7b31a99",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Due to the announcement of the new group feature. I think groups should be able to set up a home world for their groups, so that members can start the game up and instantly load into an instance with them. Depending on how the group feature actually works (I would assume you have to set a “main” group and then be able to have side groups to join/follow. Your main group would be the group home that you spawn into. As for how it would determine what instance to set you, I think the best way would be to dedicate an instance number to that group, so that it would allow them to join the instance. Hope this idea finds its way to be included into the group feature.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Group home worlds",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "6388d67b8b04a12dd8c8909d",
