      "mergedPostDetails": "Fantastic to have the new instance options, but there's one more addition I feel is a must have, and that would be group hubs.\n\nSimilar to how setting a home world works, it could be something a group owner, or mods, could set for the group itself as a sort of official world.\n\nThen the players could choose between spawning in a home world or spawning in the group hub of which ever group they're representing.",
